# stab_combined_aggressive_sustained.scn — STABILIZE, SUSTAINED simultaneous
# 3-axis hold (vehicle, Layer 2, sustained-disturbance archetype 3/3)
# STABILIZE・3軸同時持続保持（vehicle, Layer 2, 持続外乱アーキタイプ 3/3）
#
# Motivation (docs/plans/smc-rate-loop-plan.md §7.17/§7.20/§7.21): see
# stab_flight_sustained.scn's header for the full background. This is the
# MULTI-AXIS (roll+pitch+yaw simultaneous) member of the 3-archetype
# sustained-disturbance set. stab_combined_aggressive.scn's D segment
# already drives all 3 axes at once, but only for 1.2 s before REVERSING
# (segment E) -- a reversal resets the error sign and does not let a
# rate-loop hyperplane integral (or an STA integral state) accumulate in one
# direction for long. Here the SAME simultaneous 3-axis deflection (D's
# magnitude) is held for 40 s WITHOUT reversing, to test whether the
# multi-axis case saturates/diverges differently from the single-axis
# (stab_flight_sustained) and combined-2-axis (pos_flight_sustained) cases.
# 動機（docs/plans/smc-rate-loop-plan.md §7.17/§7.20/§7.21）: 背景の全体は
# stab_flight_sustained.scnのヘッダ参照。本シナリオは3アーキタイプ持続外乱
# セットのうち多軸（ロール+ピッチ+ヨー同時）担当。
# stab_combined_aggressive.scnのDセグメントは既に3軸を同時に動かすが、
# 1.2秒保持した後すぐ反転（Eセグメント）——反転は誤差符号をリセットしてしまい、
# レートループの超平面積分（あるいはSTAの積分状態）が一方向に長時間蓄積する
# ことがない。本シナリオでは同じ3軸同時偏位（Dと同じ大きさ）を反転させずに
# 40秒保持し、単軸（stab_flight_sustained）・複合2軸（pos_flight_sustained）
# とは異なる飽和・発散の仕方をするかを検証する。
#
# Sticks: raw 12-bit ADC, centre 2048. roll/pitch magnitudes are REDUCED
# from stab_combined_aggressive.scn's D segment (raw 2600/2600, ~+8/+8 deg,
# ~11.3 deg combined tilt) to raw 2440/2440 (~+5.7/+5.7 deg, ~8.1 deg
# combined) -- matching the other 2 sustained archetypes' total tilt. Yaw
# magnitude (raw 2400) is unchanged (yaw uses a separate CW/CCW reaction-
# torque mechanism, not the roll/pitch differential-thrust budget this
# reduction targets). See the 2026-09-11 note below for why.
# スティックはraw 12bit ADC（中央2048）。roll/pitchの大きさは
# stab_combined_aggressive.scnのDセグメント（raw 2600/2600、~+8/+8°、
# 合成傾斜~11.3°）から**縮小**し、raw 2440/2440（~+5.7/+5.7°、合成~8.1°）
# ——他2つの持続外乱アーキタイプと合成傾斜を揃えた。ヨーの大きさ
# （raw 2400）は無変更（ヨーはこの縮小が対象とするroll/pitch差動推力の
# 予算とは別のCW/CCW反力トルク機構を使うため）。理由は下記
# 2026-09-11の注記を参照。
#
# 2026-09-11 MAGNITUDE REDUCED + THROTTLE RECALIBRATED (§7.21): see
# pos_flight_sustained.scn's identical note -- an early version reusing D's
# full raw 2600/2600 roll+pitch combination held for 40 s hit the same
# known mixer/differential-authority ceiling pos_flight.scn's C2 step
# documents (crashed to the ground regardless of throttle candidate).
# Reduced to raw 2440/2440 (~8.1 deg combined, same total tilt as the other
# 2 sustained archetypes) and re-calibrated hover throttle to raw=3164 --
# the same value as stab_flight_sustained/pos_flight_sustained, since
# cos(tilt) vertical-thrust loss depends only on total tilt angle. See
# docs/plans/smc-rate-loop-plan.md §7.21.
# 2026-09-11 大きさ縮小＋スロットル再較正（§7.21）: pos_flight_sustained.scn
# の同一の注記を参照——本シナリオの初期版もDの全量raw 2600/2600の
# roll+pitch組み合わせを40秒保持しており、pos_flight.scnのC2ステップが
# 文書化する既知のミキサ/差動権限上限に同様に到達していた（試した
# どのスロットル候補でも地面に墜落）。raw 2440/2440（合成~8.1°、他2つの
# 持続外乱アーキタイプと同じ合成傾斜）へ縮小し、ホバースロットルを
# raw=3164へ再較正——stab_flight_sustained/pos_flight_sustainedと同じ値
# （cos(傾斜)による鉛直推力損失は合成傾斜角にのみ依存するため）。
# docs/plans/smc-rate-loop-plan.md §7.21参照。
#
#  <t>  ch  <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz>
   0    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     4000      50       # A: disarmed 4 s -> boot reaches IDLE_GROUND
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50       # B: ARM rising edge, idle throttle 1 s
   +    rc   3243  2048   2048    2048  1     2000      50       # C: throttle up -> TAKEOFF -> FLYING/STABILIZE
   +    rc   3164  2440   2440    2400  1     40000     50       # D: SUSTAINED simultaneous roll-right + pitch-forward + yaw-right, 40 s hold, NO reversal, reduced roll/pitch + recalibrated hover raw (§7.21)
   +    rc   3164  2048   2048    2048  1     1500      50       # E: centre -> self-level back toward 0 deg, let it settle
   +      rc    2048 2048 2048 2048  0     200       50              # release ARM button / ボタン離し
   +      rc    2048 2048 2048 2048  1     200       50              # press again -> DISARM (toggle) / 再押下=DISARM
   +      rc    2048 2048 2048 2048  0     600       50              # settle disarmed / disarm 後整定
#
# Expectation (nominal, no perturbation): bounded attitude tracking
# throughout the 40 s simultaneous 3-axis hold, no tumble, self-levels at E,
# scripted DISARM at the end. Under `--torque-authority` degradation this is
# expected to be a hard condition per §7.20/§7.21, likely the most severe
# of the 3 sustained archetypes since it combines all 3 axes' torque demand
# at once -- see docs/plans/smc-rate-loop-plan.md for the accepted-limit
# rationale before adding numeric gates for the perturbed case.
# 期待（摂動なし・公称条件）: 40秒の3軸同時保持を通じて姿勢追従は有界、転倒
# なし、Eで水平へ復帰、末尾で台本通りDISARM。`--torque-authority`低下下では
# §7.20/§7.21により困難条件と想定——3軸分のトルク要求が同時に掛かるため
# 3つの持続外乱アーキタイプの中で最も厳しくなる可能性が高い。摂動時の数値
# ゲート追加前にdocs/plans/smc-rate-loop-plan.mdの許容限界としての位置づけを
# 参照。
